#doc (Manual) "Bent functions" =>

Carlet's Chapter 6 develops the extremal nonlinear Boolean functions in even
dimension. Write $`V_n=\mathbb F_2^n`, use the unnormalized Walsh transform
$`W_f`, and denote the dual of a bent function $`f` by $`\widetilde f`.

